  "prefLabel": "Lab 303.09 Employee",
  "priorExpiration": "1999-01-18",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 303.09 \"Employee\" means any person who works full or part-time for an employer and persons who regularly operate businesses or practice trades who have elected to purchase workers' compensation coverage for themselves.\n\nSource. #2264, eff 1-6-83; ss by #2935, eff 12-27-84; ss by #4854, eff 6-29-90; ss by #5558, eff 1-18-93 (formerly Lab 303.08), EXPIRED: 1-18-99\n\nNew. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11065, eff 4-1-16 (from Lab 303.10)",
